pysyte.types.python
===================


    >>> from pysyte.streams import std
    >>> from pysyte.types.python import QUIETLY
    >>> from pysyte.types.python import Quietly
    >>> from pysyte.types.python import quietly


Doctest normally shows all streams

    >>> print_out("Hello")
    >>> print_err("World")
    Hello
    World

Suppress stderr
    >>> with quietly:
    ...     print_out("Hello")
    ...     print_err("World")
    ...
    Hello

    >>> assert "World" in fred.stderr

Suppress stdout
    >>> with Quietly:
    ...     print_out("Hello")
    ...     print_err("World")
    ...
    World

Suppress both
    >>> with QUIETLY as suppressor:
    ...     print_out("Hello")
    ...     print_err("World")
    ...

Suppressed streams were stored in attributes

    >>> assert "Hello" in fred.stdout
    >>> assert "World" in fred.stderr

